"""Live counterfactual laboratory dashboard, served alongside the observer."""
PAGE = '''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Live market ecology laboratory</title><style>body{font:16px system-ui;background:#0e1726;color:#edf4ff;margin:25px auto;max-width:1150px;padding:20px}a{color:#7fdfda}p{line-height:1.6;color:#bfcee1}.panel{background:#1a2a40;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;margin:18px 0}.cards{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}.card{flex:1;min-width:180px}.big{font-size:26px;font-weight:bold}canvas{width:100%;height:330px}.scroll{overflow:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;white-space:nowrap}th,td{padding:10px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #3d536e}th:first-child,td:first-child{text-align:left}select{padding:9px;background:#263d58;color:white}li{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.5}.badge{color:#ffd88a}</style><h1>Live market ecology laboratory</h1><p><a href="/">Live order book</a> · <span class="badge">Live observations + simulated interventions · display limit 2 seconds</span></p><p>Start with the real Bitcoin book. Ask what would happen if a simulated participant bought or sold, makers removed liquidity, or a dealer hedged an assumed gamma position. Each experiment uses its own copy of the book. These are immediate modeled effects, not predictions or observed participant activity.</p><div class="panel"><h2>Live ML and paper-signal readiness</h2><div id="mlsignal" class="big">WAIT</div><p id="mlstatus">Checking model and feed…</p><p id="trainingstatus">Live training: connecting…</p><p id="mlfeatures">Waiting for live features…</p><p>Research model loaded; Venue-specific research fitting runs in the background when enough usable data accumulates. No orders. WAIT means there is no qualified trading signal.</p></div><p id="market"></p><p id="tape"></p><div id="status" class="panel">Connecting…</div><div class="panel cards"><div class="card">Observed midpoint<div id="mid" class="big">—</div></div><div class="card">60-second illustrative Monte Carlo range<div id="mc" class="big">Warming up</div><p id="mcinfo"></p></div></div><div class="panel"><h2>Observed market mechanics · last 10 seconds</h2><p id="mechanicsStatus">Warming up…</p><div class="cards"><div class="card">Aggressive buys / sells BTC<div id="flowMechanics" class="big">—</div></div><div class="card">Observed midpoint move<div id="moveMechanics" class="big">—</div></div></div><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Displayed side</th><th>Added BTC</th><th>Reduced BTC</th><th>Add / reduction ratio</th></tr></thead><tbody id="liquidityMechanics"></tbody></table></div><p>Trade side describes the aggressor, not their identity. Added/reduced quantities are changes within 10 bps of the pre-update midpoint in the subscribed book. Reductions combine executions, cancellations and other changes. A high addition/reduction ratio can coexist with buying pressure; it does not prove who replenished liquidity or caused a price move. These are observations, separate from the hypothetical participants below.</p></div><div class="panel"><label>Compare with live price: <select id="series"><option value="large_buy_mid">Simulated 10 BTC buy</option><option value="thin_buy_mid">10 BTC buy with half the liquidity</option></select></label><canvas id="chart"></canvas><p>Teal: observed midpoint. Orange: counterfactual midpoint if that intervention happened at each sampled moment. Orange points are independent experiments, not a simulated trading trajectory.</p></div><div class="panel scroll"><h2>How much does each intervention move the book?</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Simulated intervention</th><th>Filled BTC</th><th>Unfilled BTC</th><th>Buy/sell VWAP (quote)</th><th>Hedge BTC (+ buy)</th><th>Midpoint change (quote)</th><th>Change bps</th></tr></thead><tbody id="rows"></tbody></table><p>If known liquidity is exhausted, the price effect is unknown. We do not invent deeper liquidity. No latency, replenishment, hidden orders, venue routing or maker queue fills are modeled here.</p></div><div class="panel"><h2>30-second simulated participant ecology</h2><p>A fresh live book initializes each 30-second run. Watch the scenarios advance one simulated second per wall-clock second. All three scenarios receive the same synthetic arrival tape. These are synthetic scenarios, not predictions of future live prices.</p><div id="simclock" class="big">Simulation connecting…</div><canvas id="rollchart"></canvas><p>Teal: baseline · Orange: maker B withdraws at 10–20s · Purple: assumed short gamma. A fixed simulated institution buys 1 BTC at 10s and sells 1 BTC at 20s.</p><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Baseline simulated role</th><th>Current inventory BTC</th><th>Cash change (quote)</th><th>Marked wealth (quote)</th></tr></thead><tbody id="agents"></tbody></table></div><p id="rollinfo"></p></div><div class="panel"><h2>What the models mean</h2><ul id="models"></ul><p>Book impact: consume displayed levels in price order. Gamma hedge: ΔH = −Γ × ΔS. Monte Carlo: S(T) = S(0) exp(−σ²T/2 + σ√T Z), using rolling one-second log returns. It assumes zero expected price drift and constant volatility.</p></div><script>let data;const f=x=>x==null?'—':Number(x).toFixed(3);function chart(){let el=document.getElementById('chart');el.width=el.clientWidth;el.height=330;let c=el.getContext('2d');if(!data)return;let rows=data.history.filter(x=>x.time_ms>=data.generated_ns/1e6-120000),key=document.getElementById('series').value,values=rows.flatMap(x=>[x.observed_mid,x[key]]).filter(x=>x!=null);if(!values.length)return;let lo=Math.min(...values),hi=Math.max(...values);if(hi===lo){lo-=.1;hi+=.1}let t0=rows[0].time_ms,t1=rows.at(-1).time_ms;c.fillStyle='#bfcee1';c.fillText(f(hi)+' '+data.quote_currency,5,15);c.fillText(f(lo)+' '+data.quote_currency,5,325);for(let [k,color] of [['observed_mid','#73d8cf'],[key,'#ffb267']]){c.strokeStyle=color;c.beginPath();let active=false,previous=null;for(let r of rows){if(r[k]==null||previous!=null&&r.time_ms-previous>1500)active=false;if(r[k]!=null){let x=20+(r.time_ms-t0)/Math.max(1,t1-t0)*(el.width-40),y=25+(hi-r[k])/(hi-lo)*280;active?c.lineTo(x,y):c.moveTo(x,y);active=true}previous=r.time_ms}c.stroke()}}function rolloutChart(){document.getElementById('simclock').textContent='SIMULATION RUNNING · '+data.rollouts.simulation_second+' / 29 seconds';let el=document.getElementById('rollchart');el.width=el.clientWidth;el.height=330;let c=el.getContext('2d'),r=data.rollouts,vals=['baseline','withdrawal','short_gamma'].flatMap(k=>r[k].trace.map(x=>x.move_bps)).filter(x=>x!=null);if(!vals.length)return;let lo=Math.min(...vals),hi=Math.max(...vals);if(hi===lo){lo-=.1;hi+=.1}c.fillStyle='#bfcee1';c.fillText('Modeled midpoint change: '+f(lo)+' to '+f(hi)+' bps · 0–29 simulated seconds',10,15);for(let [key,color] of [['baseline','#73d8cf'],['withdrawal','#ffb267'],['short_gamma','#cc9cff']]){c.beginPath();c.strokeStyle=color;let active=false;for(let row of r[key].trace){if(row.move_bps==null){active=false;continue}let x=20+row.second/29*(el.width-40),y=25+(hi-row.move_bps)/(hi-lo)*280;active?c.lineTo(x,y):c.moveTo(x,y);active=true}c.stroke()}document.getElementById('agents').innerHTML=r.baseline.participants.map(p=>`<tr><td>${p.role}</td><td>${f(p.inventory_btc)}</td><td>${f(p.cash_quote)}</td><td>${f(p.marked_wealth_quote)}</td></tr>`).join('');document.getElementById('rollinfo').textContent='Live book anchor: '+new Date(r.generated_ns/1e6).toISOString()+' · source update '+r.source_update_id+'. '+r.baseline.assumptions.replaceAll('USDT',data.quote_currency)+' Baseline paid fees: '+f(r.baseline.total_paid_fees_quote)+' '+data.quote_currency+'. Marked wealth is not realized exit profit.'}function showMechanics(s){let m=s.mechanics;document.getElementById('mechanicsStatus').textContent=m&&m.status!=='unavailable'?'Receipt-time window · '+f(m.coverage_seconds)+' / 10 seconds · '+m.status+' · associations, not causal attribution':'Mechanics unavailable';document.getElementById('flowMechanics').textContent=m&&m.status!=='unavailable'?f(m.taker_buy_btc)+' / '+f(m.taker_sell_btc):'—';document.getElementById('moveMechanics').textContent=m&&m.status!=='unavailable'?f(m.observed_midpoint_move_bps)+' bps':'—';document.getElementById('liquidityMechanics').innerHTML=m&&m.status!=='unavailable'?[['Bid',m.bid_added_btc,m.bid_removed_btc,m.bid_add_remove_ratio],['Ask',m.ask_added_btc,m.ask_removed_btc,m.ask_add_remove_ratio]].map(r=>`<tr><td>${r[0]}</td><td>${f(r[1])}</td><td>${f(r[2])}</td><td>${f(r[3])}</td></tr>`).join(''):''}function liveDiagnostics(s){let mo=s.model_observation;document.getElementById('mlfeatures').textContent=mo?'Received bundle features · top imbalance '+f(mo.features[0])+' · depth imbalance '+f(mo.features[1])+' · spread '+f(mo.features[3])+' bps · OFI '+f(mo.best_quote_ofi_btc)+' BTC · received '+new Date(mo.available_ns/1e6).toISOString():'Live bundle features unavailable';let lt=s.live_training;document.getElementById('trainingstatus').textContent=lt?'Live venue research training · '+lt.status+' · '+lt.buffered_feature_bundles+' buffered bundles · '+(lt.usable_examples??lt.training_examples??'pending')+' audited examples'+(lt.scores?' · model Brier '+f(lt.scores.brier)+' / baseline '+f(lt.baseline.brier):''):'Live training unavailable';let tc=s.training_capture;if(tc)document.getElementById('mlfeatures').textContent+=' · captured bundles '+tc.feature_bundles+' · labeled count pending audit';let ms=s.model_status;document.getElementById('mlsignal').textContent=ms?ms.signal:'WAIT';document.getElementById('mlstatus').textContent=ms?ms.model_id+' · '+ms.trained_on+' · '+ms.reasons.join('. '):'Model status unavailable';if(s.status!=='running')document.getElementById('mlfeatures').textContent+=' · feed flagged '+s.reason+'; not usable for trading';}function clear(reason){document.getElementById('trainingstatus').textContent='Live training display unavailable';document.getElementById('mlfeatures').textContent='Live features unavailable';document.getElementById('mlsignal').textContent='WAIT';document.getElementById('mlstatus').textContent=reason;showMechanics({});document.getElementById('status').textContent=reason;document.getElementById('mid').textContent='—';document.getElementById('mc').textContent='Unavailable';document.getElementById('mcinfo').textContent='';document.getElementById('rows').textContent='';data=null;chart();document.getElementById('simclock').textContent='SIMULATION PAUSED';document.getElementById('agents').textContent='';document.getElementById('rollinfo').textContent='';let rc=document.getElementById('rollchart');rc.getContext('2d').clearRect(0,0,rc.width,rc.height)}async function draw(){try{let started=performance.now();let response=await fetch('ecology.json',{cache:'no-store',signal:AbortSignal.timeout(2000)});if(!response.ok)throw Error('unavailable');let s=await response.json();document.getElementById('market').textContent=s.provider+' · '+s.symbol+' · '+s.product+' · '+s.validation;document.getElementById('tape').textContent=s.trade_subscription_active?'Research capture: book + trades · '+s.captured_trade_events+' trade events received · temporary storage; lost on restart. No live trading model is qualified.':'Research trade subscription unavailable · no live trading model is qualified.';let serverNow=Number(response.headers.get('X-Observer-Time-Ms')),pageAge=serverNow-s.generated_ns/1e6,transit=performance.now()-started;if(s.mode!=='replay'&&(!serverNow||pageAge<0||pageAge+transit>2000)){clear('Observer data unavailable or delayed · experiments paused');return}document.getElementById('models').replaceChildren(...Object.entries(s.models).map(([k,v])=>{let li=document.createElement('li');li.textContent=v;return li}));if(s.status!=='running'){clear('Experiments paused · '+s.reason);liveDiagnostics(s);return}data=s;liveDiagnostics(s);showMechanics(s);document.getElementById('status').textContent='LIVE · '+(s.research_usable?'fast feed':'delayed feed')+' · age '+f(s.receipt_minus_event_ms)+' ms · silence '+f(s.silence_ms)+' ms · update '+s.source_update_id+' · roles and gamma are assumptions';document.getElementById('mid').textContent=f(s.observed_mid)+' '+s.quote_currency;let m=s.monte_carlo;document.getElementById('mc').textContent=m.status==='warming_up'?'Warming up '+m.samples+'/'+m.required:f(m.p05)+' – '+f(m.p95);document.getElementById('mcinfo').textContent=m.status==='warming_up'?'Requires 61 consecutive fresh one-second samples.':m.caveat+' '+m.return_samples+' rolling returns; 1,000 paths.';document.getElementById('rows').innerHTML=s.scenarios.map(r=>`<tr><td>${r.name}</td><td>${f(r.initiating_filled_btc)}</td><td>${f(r.initiating_unfilled_btc)}</td><td>${f(r.initiating_vwap)}</td><td>${f(r.hedge_signed_btc)}</td><td>${f(r.move_quote)}</td><td>${f(r.move_bps)}</td></tr>`).join('');chart();rolloutChart()}catch(e){clear('Cannot load experiments')}}document.getElementById('series').onchange=chart;addEventListener('resize',()=>{chart();if(data)rolloutChart()});draw();setInterval(draw,1000)</script></html>'''
